# Supply Chain Analytics & Automation Project

## Overview

This project simulates a real-world supply chain analytics and automation workflow using:

- Python
- PostgreSQL
- pandas
- SQL
- Automation scripting

The project focuses on:
- ETL and data cleaning
- KPI reporting
- Operations automation
- SQL reporting workflows
- AI-generated business summaries

The goal is to replicate practical analyst and supply chain automation workflows commonly used in e-commerce and operations environments.

