# KPI Report Automation

Automated KPI reporting pipeline that calculates and exports:

- Revenue
- Gross Profit
- Inventory Turnover
- Days on Hand
- Fill Rate
- Lead Time
- Freight % of Revenue
- On-Time Delivery Rate
- Stockout Rate

---

### Output Files

```
kpi_summary.csv
abc_analysis.csv
supplier_performance.csv
```

---

## CSV Cleaning Automation

Automated ETL pipeline that:

- Connects to PostgreSQL
- Reads operational tables
- Cleans and standardizes data
- Handles NULLs and invalid values
- Exports cleaned datasets

### Cleaned Datasets

```
cleaned_customer_orders.csv
cleaned_inventory.csv
cleaned_order_items.csv
cleaned_products.csv
cleaned_purchase_orders.csv
cleaned_shipments.csv
cleaned_suppliers.csv
```

---

## Email Summary Automation

Automated email workflows that:

- Generate KPI summaries
- Attach CSV reports
- Send automated status emails

---

# Operations Automation

## Inventory Alerts

Automated inventory monitoring system that detects:

- Stockout risk
- Low inventory levels
- Reorder point alerts

### Business Logic

```
Reorder Point =
Average Daily Sales × Lead Time
```

---

## Freight Audit Automation

Automated freight exception reporting that identifies:

- Unusually high freight charges
- Freight cost outliers
- Potential overbilling risks

### Output

```
freight_audit_exceptions.csv
```

---

## Reconciliation Automation

Automated reconciliation workflows that detect:

- Orders without shipments
- Missing operational records
- Revenue/shipment mismatches

### Output

```
reconciliation_exceptions.csv
```

---

