# Power BI Dashboards

Interactive Power BI dashboards were built using automated CSV outputs generated by the Python ETL and reporting workflows.

The dashboards automatically refresh whenever updated CSV outputs are generated from the automation pipeline.

## Executive Dashboard
Includes:
- Revenue KPIs
- Inventory Turnover
- Fill Rate
- Freight % of Revenue
- Revenue Trends
- Sales by Region
- Top Products

## Inventory Dashboard
Includes:
- Inventory by Warehouse
- Inventory Value by Category
- Stockout Risk
- Reorder Alerts
- ABC Analysis

## Supplier Dashboard
Includes:
- Supplier Fill Rate
- Supplier Lead Time
- Supplier Ranking
- Low Performance Suppliers

## Freight Dashboard
Includes:
- Freight Spend by Carrier
- Freight Cost Outliers
- Delivery Delays
- On-Time Delivery Performance

---

## Power BI Workflow

```text
PostgreSQL
↓
Python ETL & Automation
↓
Export CSV Outputs
↓
